sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Session (container, no crew token)
  participant P as aeolus plugin scripts and hooks
  participant T as Trierarch (host, holds the crew token)
  participant F as Fleet
  Note over T,F: The trierarch registers, keeps the crew token
  T->>T: open a socket in the ship's folder, mounted into the container
  T->>S: start the session, identity names the socket
  S->>P: send (selector, payload, idempotency key)
  P->>T: POST /api/v1/ship/send over the socket, no bearer
  alt path not the fleet's API, register, deregister, or body too large
    T-->>P: refused by the trierarch, fixed code, nothing sent
  else forwarded
    T->>F: same call, bearer of the socket's ship
    alt stored
      F-->>T: 200 messageId
      T-->>P: 200 messageId, unchanged
    else refused (scope, NOT_REACHABLE, payload)
      F-->>T: refusal, nothing stored
      T-->>P: same refusal, unchanged
    else busy (503)
      F-->>T: 503, nothing stored
      T-->>P: 503, the plugin calls again with the same key
    else LEASE_ENDED
      F-->>T: 401 LEASE_ENDED
      T-->>P: 401 LEASE_ENDED, the plugin forgets the ship
    else no answer from the fleet
      T-->>P: no answer, exit 6, the key sent again later
    end
  end
  opt trierarch down or restarting
    P-xT: no answer, exit 6, nothing stored, the session goes on
  end
  Note over T,S: Hand-over unchanged: the trierarch types the line, the hook acks through the socket
